## 步骤2：sudo权限最小化

### 2.1 移除NOPASSWD权限

**编辑sudoers文件**：
```bash
ssh rootadmin@124.107.126.226 "sudo visudo -f /etc/sudoers.d/rootadmin"
```

**删除所有NOPASSWD行，保留密码验证**：
```
rootadmin ALL=(ALL) ALL
```

**设置正确权限**：
```bash
ssh rootadmin@124.107.126.226 "sudo chmod 440 /etc/sudoers.d/rootadmin"
```

**验证**：
```bash
ssh rootadmin@124.107.126.226 "sudo -l"
```

---

## 步骤3：安装fail2ban

### 3.1 安装fail2ban
```bash
ssh rootadmin@124.107.126.226 "sudo apt install fail2ban -y"
```

### 3.2 配置fail2ban

**创建jail.local**：
```bash
ssh rootadmin@124.107.126.226 << 'EOF'
sudo bash -c 'cat > /etc/fail2ban/jail.local << CONF
[sshd]
enabled = true
port = ssh
logpath = /var/log/auth.log
maxretry = 3
bantime = 600
findtime = 600

[http-server]
enabled = true
port = 3001
logpath = /var/log/daemon.log
maxretry = 5
bantime = 300
findtime = 300
CONF'
EOF
```

### 3.3 启动fail2ban
```bash
ssh rootadmin@124.107.126.226 "sudo systemctl enable fail2ban && sudo systemctl restart fail2ban"
```

