## 步骤4：配置UFW防火墙

### 4.1 安装UFW
```bash
ssh rootadmin@124.107.126.226 "sudo apt install ufw -y"
```

### 4.2 配置规则
```bash
ssh rootadmin@124.107.126.226 << 'EOF'
# 默认策略：拒绝所有
sudo ufw default deny incoming
sudo ufw default deny outgoing

# 允许必要端口
sudo ufw allow 22/tcp
sudo ufw allow 80/tcp
sudo ufw allow 443/tcp
sudo ufw allow 3001/tcp
sudo ufw allow 5173/tcp

# 启用防火墙
sudo ufw enable
EOF
```

### 4.3 验证状态
```bash
ssh rootadmin@124.107.126.226 "sudo ufw status verbose"
```

