## 步骤5：系统更新和漏洞管理

### 5.1 应用安全更新
```bash
ssh rootadmin@124.107.126.226 << 'EOF'
# 停止卡住的apt进程
sudo pkill -9 apt-get 2>/dev/null || true
sudo pkill -9 dpkg 2>/dev/null || true

# 清理锁定文件
sudo rm -f /var/lib/apt/lists/lock-frontend /var/lib/apt/lists/lock

# 更新并升级系统
sudo apt update
sudo apt upgrade -y
EOF
```

### 5.2 检查更新状态
```bash
ssh rootadmin@124.107.126.226 "sudo apt list --upgradable | head -10"
```

