## 步骤8：创建安全监控脚本

### 8.1 创建每日安全报告
```bash
ssh rootadmin@124.107.126.226 << 'EOF'
sudo bash -c 'cat > /usr/local/bin/security-daily.sh << SCRIPT
#!/bin/bash
echo "=== Daily Security Summary - $(date) ==="
echo "Open Ports:"
sudo ss -tlnp | grep LISTEN | awk "{print \$4}" | cut -d: -f2 | sort -u
echo ""
echo "Failed SSH Attempts (last 24h):"
sudo grep "Failed password" /var/log/auth.log | tail -5 | wc -l
echo ""
echo "Root Login Attempts (last 24h):"
sudo grep "Invalid user root" /var/log/auth.log | tail -5 | wc -l
echo ""
echo "Active Fail2ban Bans:"
sudo fail2ban-client status sshd 2>/dev/null | grep "Banned IP" || echo "None"
SCRIPT
chmod +x /usr/local/bin/security-daily.sh
'

# 添加到cron（每天凌晨2点执行）
ssh rootadmin@124.107.126.226 "sudo bash -c 'echo \"0 2 * * * root /usr/local/bin/security-daily.sh\" >> /etc/cron.d/security-monitor'"
EOF
```

### 8.2 手动运行一次
```bash
ssh rootadmin@124.107.126.226 "sudo /usr/local/bin/security-daily.sh"
```

